feat: apply Sinapse brand design system + add adaptive GitHub cron

Design changes (Sinapse B&W palette):
- Color palette: #0A0A0A (Vanta), #F5F5F0 (Bone), grayscale only
- Typography: Sora (display), Inter (body), JetBrains Mono (code)
- SVG grain overlay at 5% opacity (always active)
- Extreme typography scale: micro (11px) or display (60-180px)
- Asymmetric layouts - no centered/grid symmetry
- Reduced motion support (prefers-reduced-motion)
- Minimal shadows, no glassmorphism
- Updated login, layout, projects list, project card to brand

Cron feature:
- Adaptive interval: hourly if updates, daily after 24h, weekly after 7d
- /api/cron/github endpoint (POST with CRON_SECRET)
- /api/cron/status endpoint (GET, authenticated)
- Check active webhook subscriptions for new GitHub commits
- Auto-download and create version on new commits

